title: Canonical versioned message JSON v1 (shipped J1-J5)
---
SHIPPED through J1-J5. `C2c_schema_v1` defines the lean versioned message shape, including `schema_version: 1`, canonical sender/recipient/content fields, and `delivery.state` (`queued`, `queued_offline`, `accepted`, `delivered`).

CLI send/poll/wait/peek JSON, relay DM send/poll/peek, MCP send/poll/peek, and monitor NDJSON message events use the shared v1 contract while preserving legacy keys additively. The J5 aggregate closure gate validates every adapted production builder, round-trip stability, and duplicate-key absence.

Identity/trust fields and priority remain reserved for v2. Deliberately excluded diagnostic, storage, history, and aggregate-receipt surfaces are documented separately and do not keep I002 open.
